    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n7384" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">censŭālis</span></b> , e,
			adj.
		census, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>of or pertaining to a census</i> (in late and jurid. Lat.): 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">forma,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">Dig.
					50, 15, 4</span></i>
			: 
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">vincula, ib.: professiones,</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">ib.
					50, 4, 18</span></i>
			.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>II.</b>
			<i>Subst.</i>: <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">censŭ-āles</span></b> , ium,
				m.
		</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>A.</b>
			<i>Those who make out the censor</i>'<i>s
				lists</i>, <i><span class="en">Capitol. Gord. 12</span></i>;
			Cod. Th. 8, tit. 2; <i><span class="en">Symm. Ep. 10,
			43</span></i>.—</div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>B.</b>
			<i>The censor</i>'<i>s lists</i>,
					<i><span class="en">Tert. Apol. 19</span></i>.</div>
